{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104492","id":2411369295,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PupNP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104492/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104492/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/760aea71fe5f8c421b3caac7bbe9d2bc000aa9d0","number":104492,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Allow the `filename_filter` property to be changed.","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes #104067 in a hacky way.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd9cb590-ced5-4b7a-9b21-f1522236a20f)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd2ed2a3-9a5d-44a0-96b7-ff8a467d0021)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/910f6828-c738-4d79-ac11-7f4f00da85fc)\r\n\r\nA downside of this PR is that if the property is hidden away using this code\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends FileDialog\r\n\r\nfunc _validate_property(property:Dictionary):\r\n\tif property.name == \"filename_filter\":\r\n\t\tproperty.usage = PROPERTY_USAGE_NO_EDITOR\r\n```\r\nThe `filename_filter` property persists and still works. I could not find a fix for this, but suggestions are welcome. Using the code in commit `14f519f47425a2062542f1f70aa68622be617e88` does not work due to some unknown reason. I even tried doing it like this\r\n```cpp\r\n\tif (!filename_filter_box->is_visible()) {\r\n\t\tfile_name_filter.clear();\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\nHowever that failed to provide the desired effect. As of now, it seems that removing the faulty code is the only way to proceed. \r\n\r\nIt appears that using `!show_filename_filter` makes the box permanently uneditable as it is being cleared all the time, and using `show_filename_filter` allows editing but does not clear the box when it is hidden away then un-hidden. Truly quite a deep problem. I couldn't figure out how to print messages so that I could debug the state of `show_filename_filter`, and exactly pinpoint what was going wrong.\r\n\r\nNOTE : Ready to merge.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyN